message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it using this metadata."
title: finitegeom
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Rudd
    given-names: Tavis
    email: "tavis@damnsimple.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-6405-3275"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tavisrudd/finitegeom"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalizations supporting papers on Clebsch geometry, arcs complete
  outside a prescribed conic, projective Reed–Solomon deep holes, local-unitary
  rigidity of stabilizer AME states, and bounded repair ports. Version 0.1.0
  establishes the shared finite-geometry foundation; later releases add
  explicitly audited paper-facing theorem closures.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - finite geometry
  - Clebsch geometry
  - coding theory
  - Reed–Solomon codes
  - quantum information
  - algebraic combinatorics
